content.comment:
Dear all reviewers, we upload a revision of this paper that differs from the previous one in that
1) As suggested by AnonReviewer3, we implemented the Hierarchical CNN (called Hrchy-CNN in the paper) as a baseline, and we then applied this model to SNLI and SICK datasets, which showed that the proposed model, Bi-BloSAN, still outperforms the Hierarchical CNN by a large margin; 
2) We fixed some typos.

